{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who are you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Ares, a dog without a permanent home. At first, your day seemed like any other, you returned from a short trip, only to suddenly find yourself alone. Confused and with little food, you try to come to terms with your situation, but then fate takes a turn: An unfamiliar dog appears in your territory. Find your path through a world abandoned by humans as you search for them. Lead your pack forward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What can you expect on this journey?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through multiple open worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to local frequencies for signals from humans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find diary entries, notes, laptops, smartphones, and anything that gives you clues about the last thoughts of humans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other dogs along the way and exchange information with them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your nose to track scents and reach new places</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open doors, break into houses, and explore the area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play tag and hide-and-seek</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your pack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always have your trailer with you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for supplies and shelters for the night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles to get information</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a relationship with the dogs in your pack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painted graphics</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3184440?t=1766526009","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s